  "caption_groups": [
    {
      "start": 0.852083,
      "end": 2.727083,
      "text": "In Europe, beavers were reduced to"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.753125,
      "end": 5.057833,
      "text": "fragmented populations, with combined"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.070833,
      "end": 7.128166,
      "text": "population numbers being estimated at"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.141166,
      "end": 8.260958,
      "text": "various locations."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.976083,
      "end": 12.280790999999999,
      "text": "Beavers live in freshwater ecosystems such"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.293790999999999,
      "end": 14.910998999999999,
      "text": "as rivers, streams, lakes and ponds across"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.937040999999999,
      "end": 15.965707999999998,
      "text": "their natural range."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.284083,
      "end": 19.771082999999997,
      "text": "The concept became popular in conservation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.070541,
      "end": 21.450791,
      "text": "and was deployed in a range of"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.476791,
      "end": 23.260665999999997,
      "text": "contexts to engender support."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.592083,
      "end": 26.766582,
      "text": "This approach was mobilized especially where"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.779583,
      "end": 29.123374000000002,
      "text": "human activities had damaged ecosystems,"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.344707999999997,
      "end": 31.480124999999997,
      "text": "such as by removing keystone predators."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.812082999999994,
      "end": 35.27304099999999,
      "text": "In addition, wolves often kept animals from"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.299082999999996,
      "end": 36.83554099999999,
      "text": "grazing in riparian areas,"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.12199999999999,
      "end": 39.374582,
      "text": "maintaining the balance of local wildlife."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.72008299999999,
      "end": 42.68624899999999,
      "text": "This protection prevented beavers from"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.712290999999986,
      "end": 44.76958299999999,
      "text": "having their vital food sources encroached"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.79562499999999,
      "end": 46.462290999999986,
      "text": "upon by large herbivores."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.788082999999986,
      "end": 49.51987399999999,
      "text": "The connectivity of streams to their"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.545915999999984,
      "end": 51.577165999999984,
      "text": "adjacent floodplain along their entire"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.60320799999999,
      "end": 53.15266599999999,
      "text": "length plays an important role."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.472082999999984,
      "end": 57.03720699999998,
      "text": "Stream restoration or river restoration aims"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.06324999999998,
      "end": 58.95916599999998,
      "text": "to improve the environmental health of a"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.97729099999998,
      "end": 59.99295799999999,
      "text": "river or stream."
    }
  ],
